  "text": "proprium.dominica-infra-octavam-nativitatis-graduale",
  "about": "The graduale of the formulary “Sunday within the Octave of the Nativity of the Lord” in the 1962 Roman Missal.",
  "segments": {
    "s01": { "translation": "Thou art fairer in beauty than the sons of men; grace is poured abroad upon Thy lips. My heart hath uttered a good word; I speak my works to the King: my tongue is the pen of a scribe that writeth swiftly." }
